profile: tinyrustlm-mirust.llms-export.current.v1
updated_utc: 2026-08-28T20:20:00Z
canonical_public_source: /llms.txt

summary:
  - TinyRustLM.MiRust.com is the current developer portal for the one prelaunch TinyRustLM.com product and its sole six-member SLM2 path.
  - The default package transaction is TinyRustLM.Abstractions, TinyRustLM.Core, and TinyRustLM.P2P; TinyRustLM.MemoryEndpoints is separately optional.
  - MemoryEndpoints.com has exactly two separate uses: direct ecosystem-agent coordination and the explicit TinyRustLM.com Connect user plugin.
  - Project sites do not receive prompts or model bytes. No live capability, publication, or campaign progress is claimed without exact evidence.
  - Historical `.slm` material is labeled evidence only and has no current runtime or compatibility authority.

redundancy:
  - Current .uai, wiki, public-safe notes, and approved private stores may duplicate prelaunch memory for resilience.
  - Every maintained copy must remain current, secret-safe, provenance-labeled, and noncontradictory.
